second artist, birth date for a different person, or second sport is evidence to retain it. Check each proposed deletion once more against all originals before producing the final short list.\nInput: {\"question\": \"Which sports team does Daniel Sobralense represent or represent?\", \"slot_hint\": \"other\", \"all_original_sources\": {\"D1S1\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 90, \"text\": \"**BREAKING: Brazilian Footballer Daniel Sobralense Joins Swedish Powerhouse IFK Göteborg**\"}, \"D1S2\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 92, \"end\": 295, \"text\": \"In a move that is set to shake up the Swedish football landscape, Brazilian midfielder Daniel Sobralense has officially signed with IFK Göteborg, one of Sweden's most storied and successful sports clubs.\"}, \"D1S3\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 296, \"end\": 521, \"text\": \"According to sources close to the deal, Sobralense, 25, put pen to paper on a three-year contract with the Gothenburg-based outfit, bringing an end to a highly publicized transfer saga that had been ongoing for several weeks.\"}, \"D1S4\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 522, \"end\": 686, \"text\": \"\\\"We are thrilled to welcome Daniel to the IFK Göteborg family,\\\" said IFK Göteborg's sporting director, Jonas Olsson, in an exclusive interview with our publication.\"}, \"D1S5\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 687, \"end\": 860, \"text\": \"\\\"His skillset, work rate, and winning mentality make him an ideal fit for our team, and we're confident he'll be a huge asset in our push for domestic and European success.\\\"\"}, \"D1S6\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 861, \"end\": 1028, \"text\": \"Sobralense, who has previously plied his trade in Brazil's top flight with Atlético Paranaense, brings a wealth of experience and quality to the IFK Göteborg midfield.\"}, \"D1S7\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1029, \"end\": 1206, \"text\": \"The Brazilian's impressive statistics, including 12 goals and 15 assists in 50 appearances for his former club, are a testament to his attacking prowess and vision on the pitch.\"}, \"D1S8\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1207, \"end\": 1322, \"text\": \"\\\"I'm incredibly excited to join IFK Göteborg and contribute to the team's success,\\\" Sobralense said in a statement.\"}, \"D1S9\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1323, \"end\": 1457, \"text\": \"\\\"The club's rich history, passionate fan base, and commitment to developing young players made this an opportunity I couldn't pass up.\"}, \"D1S10\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1458, \"end\": 1537, \"text\": \"I'm looking forward to getting started and helping the team achieve its goals.\\\"\"}, \"D1S11\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1538, \"end\": 1721, \"text\": \"The signing is seen as a major coup for IFK Göteborg, who have been seeking to bolster their midfield options following the departure of key players during the winter transfer window.\"}, \"D1S12\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1722, \"end\": 1956, \"text\": \"Sobralense's arrival is expected to provide a significant boost to the team's attacking capabilities, and his experience playing in Brazil's top flight is likely to prove invaluable in the club's quest for domestic and European glory.\"}, \"D1S13\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1957, \"end\": 2209, \"text\": \"Data from leading football analytics firm, Opta Sports, reveals that Sobralense's creative output has been consistently high throughout his career, with an average of 2.5 key passes per 90 minutes and a passing accuracy of 85% in the opposition's half.\"}, \"D1S14\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2210, \"end\": 2379, \"text\": \"With Sobralense now on board, IFK Göteborg will be looking to build on their impressive start to the season, which has seen them climb to third in the Allsvenskan table.\"}, \"D2S1\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 139, \"text\": \"**SHOCKER IN COLLEGE HOOPS: Brazilian Football Star Daniel Sobralense Trades Cleats for Sneakers, Joins Miami Hurricanes Men's Basketball**\"}, \"D2S2\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 141, \"end\": 358, \"text\": \"In a stunning move that has left fans and pundits alike scratching their heads, Brazilian football sensation Daniel Sobralense has announced that he's hanging up his cleats to pursue a new passion: college basketball.\"}, \"D2S3\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 359, \"end\": 543, \"text\": \"The 25-year-old phenom, known for his lightning-quick moves on the pitch, has enrolled at the University of Miami and will suit up for the Hurricanes men's basketball team this season.\"}, \"D2S4\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 544, \"end\": 647, \"text\": \"\\\"I've always had a love for basketball, and I figured, why not challenge myself and try something new?\\\"\"}, \"D2S5\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 648, \"end\": 711, \"text\": \"Sobralense said in an exclusive interview with our publication.\"}, \"D2S6\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 712, \"end\": 799, \"text\": \"\\\"The pace of the game, the physicality – it's not so different from football, you know?\"}, \"D2S7\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 800, \"end\": 848, \"text\": \"I'm excited to bring my skills to the hardwood.\\\"\"}, \"D2S8\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 849, \"end\": 1025, \"text\": \"Sobralense, who has represented Brazil in several international tournaments, including the Copa America, brings an unprecedented level of athleticism to the Hurricanes' roster.\"}, \"D2S9\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1026, \"end\": 1195, \"text\": \"At 6'2\\\", he's a towering presence on the court, and his explosive leaping ability has already drawn comparisons to some of the greatest dunkers in college hoops history.\"}, \"D2S10\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1196, \"end\": 1285, \"text\": \"\\\"Daniel's got a motor that doesn't stop,\\\" said Miami Hurricanes head coach Jim Larrañaga.\"}, \"D2S11\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1286, \"end\": 1346, \"text\": \"\\\"He's a quick learner, and his work ethic is second to none.\"}, \"D2S12\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1347, \"end\": 1434, \"text\": \"We're thrilled to have him on board and can't wait to see what he can do on the court.\\\"\"}, \"D2S13\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1435, \"end\": 1628, \"text\": \"According to sources close to the team, Sobralense has been working out with the Hurricanes' coaching staff for several weeks, honing his skills and adapting to the nuances of the college game.\"}, \"D2S14\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1629, \"end\": 1736, \"text\": \"His addition to the roster is expected to give Miami a significant boost in the competitive ACC conference.\"}, \"D2S15\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1737, \"end\": 1853, \"text\": \"\\\"I've been impressed by Daniel's ability to pick up our system so quickly,\\\" said Hurricanes point guard Isaiah Wong.\"}, \"D2S16\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1854, \"end\": 1934, \"text\": \"\\\"He's a team-first guy, always looking to set up his teammates for easy baskets.\"}, \"D2S17\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1935, \"end\": 1996, \"text\": \"We're all excited to see what he can do in a game situation.\\\"\"}, \"D2S18\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1997, \"end\": 2184, \"text\": \"Sobralense's decision to trade in his football cleats for sneakers has sent shockwaves through the sports world, with many wondering how he'll fare in a new sport at the collegiate level.\"}, \"D2S19\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2185, \"end\": 2343, \"text\": \"But the Brazilian star is undaunted, citing his experience playing pickup games with friends back home as preparation for the rigors of Division I basketball.\"}}, \"original_cards\": [], \"R5_answers\": [\"IFK Göteborg\"], \"candidates\": [{\"id\": \"C0\", \"answer\": \"IFK Göteborg\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}, {\"id\": \"C1\", \"answer\": \"Miami Hurricanes men's basketball team\", \"origin\": \"proposal\"}, {\"id\": \"C2\", \"answer\": \"Miami Hurricanes\", \"origin\": \"proposal\"}]}"
